<title>USA: Bell Atlantic sets NYNEX merger vote.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic sets NYNEX merger vote.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp said Friday it would hold a special shareholder meeting on Friday, November 8, to vote on its proposed merger with NYNEX Corp.</p>
<p>The meeting will begin at 1030 EST/1530 GMT at the Landmark Theater in Richmond, Va.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
